		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Cherry tree kami. Appears as a bark-skinned woman covered in cherry blossoms.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 47, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 staff +7 (1d4 + age), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Age</strong>. Magically make target younger (lose 1d4 INT, WIS, or CHA permanently), or older (lose 1d4 STR, DEX, or CON permanently). Permanent, restoration spell heals.</p><p></p><p><strong>Ward</strong>. Kami protects an old cherry tree or cherry grove. Can merge into warded area and observe everything occurring there.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
